{"id":"lesson-1722","topicId":1722,"title":"古诗词诵读","sourceTitle":"古诗词诵读","blockId":"bixiu-shang","blockTitle":"必修上","forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1722","createdAt":"2024-08-21T15:57:38Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-21T16:09:28Z","postCount":4,"excerpt":"选自《诗经注析》（中华书局1991 年版）。 《诗经·邶风》 静女其姝[1]，俟[2]我于城隅[3]。 爱[4]而不见，搔首踟蹰[5]。 静女其娈[6]，贻我彤管[7]。 彤管有炜[8]，说怿女美[9]。 自牧归荑[10]，洵美且异[11]。 匪女之为美[12]，美人之贻。 这是一首古老的爱情诗。开篇先以男子之口，引出一位娴静而美丽的女子。接着叙述她原本与男子约定相会，却“爱而不见”，令男子独自徘徊，这样的场景，表现了爱情萌发时的甜蜜和欢乐。接下来说静女赠送的彤管很美丽、讨人喜爱，后面又退一步说并非彤管好，而是因为它是美人赠送的。如此反复借彤管“表白”，其实都是抒发对静女的爱，真实且有情趣。诵读这首诗，思考“彤管”这类美好事物在诗中的象征作用，感受反复手法在表情达意上的作用。 [color=red]静女其姝（shū）：娴静的女子很漂亮。姝，美丽、漂亮。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]俟（sì）：等待。[/color","textbook":{"bookId":"高中_语文_普通高中教科书_语文必修_上册","bookTitle":"普通高中教科书·语文必修 上册（人教版）","imageBase":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a","tocLabel":null,"tocScore":null,"startPage":null,"pages":[],"pageImages":[]},"forumImages":[],"resources":[{"href":"#footnote-11163-1","text":"[1]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11163-2","text":"[2]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11163-3","text":"[3]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11163-4","text":"[4]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11163-5","text":"[5]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11163-6","text":"[6]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11163-7","text":"[7]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11163-8","text":"[8]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11163-9","text":"[9]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11163-10","text":"[10]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11163-11","text":"[11]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11163-12","text":"[12]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-1","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-2","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-3","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-4","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-5","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-6","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-7","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-8","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-9","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-10","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-11","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-12","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11164-1","text":"[1]","kind":"link","postNumber":2},{"href":"#footnote-11164-2","text":"[2]","kind":"link","postNumber":2},{"href":"#footnote-11164-3","text":"[3]","kind":"link","postNumber":2},{"href":"#footnote-11164-4","text":"[4]","kind":"link","postNumber":2},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11164-1","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":2},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11164-2","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":2},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11164-3","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":2},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11164-4","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":2},{"href":"#footnote-11165-1","text":"[1]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11165-2","text":"[2]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11165-3","text":"[3]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11165-4","text":"[4]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11165-5","text":"[5]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11165-6","text":"[6]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11165-1","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11165-2","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11165-3","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11165-4","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11165-5","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11165-6","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11166-1","text":"[1]","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-11166-2","text":"[2]","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-11166-3","text":"[3]","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-11166-4","text":"[4]","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-11166-5","text":"[5]","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-11166-6","text":"[6]","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-11166-7","text":"[7]","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-11166-8","text":"[8]","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-1","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-2","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-3","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-4","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-5","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-6","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-7","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-8","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":4}],"resourceCounts":{},"annotations":[{"title":"延伸資源","body":"本課從論壇回覆抽取 60 條連結/附件，按所在樓層保留，便於追溯。"},{"title":"學習路線","body":"先讀主樓，旁看教材圖頁，再用回覆資源補證據；最後把自己的問題丟給 AI 或討論區。"}],"learningTasks":[{"id":"restate","title":"三分鐘復述","prompt":"不看原文，用三分鐘說清《古诗词诵读》的核心問題、人物/論點與一句最關鍵的證據。"},{"id":"evidence","title":"證據標註","prompt":"從主樓或教材圖頁中選兩處原文，分別標出：字面意思、語氣/修辭、可被考查的點。"},{"id":"transfer","title":"遷移追問","prompt":"結合回覆中的一條學習資源，設計一道可討論的問題，要求回答者必須回到文本取證。"}],"posts":[{"id":11163,"post_number":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-21T15:57:38Z","updated_at":"2024-08-21T15:57:38Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<blockquote>\n<p><em>选自《诗经注析》（中华书局1991 年版）。</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p>《诗经·邶风》</p>\n<p>静女其姝<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11163-1\" id=\"footnote-ref-11163-1\">[1]</a></sup>，俟<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11163-2\" id=\"footnote-ref-11163-2\">[2]</a></sup>我于城隅<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11163-3\" id=\"footnote-ref-11163-3\">[3]</a></sup>。<br>\n爱<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11163-4\" id=\"footnote-ref-11163-4\">[4]</a></sup>而不见，搔首踟蹰<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11163-5\" id=\"footnote-ref-11163-5\">[5]</a></sup>。<br>\n静女其娈<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11163-6\" id=\"footnote-ref-11163-6\">[6]</a></sup>，贻我彤管<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11163-7\" id=\"footnote-ref-11163-7\">[7]</a></sup>。<br>\n彤管有炜<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11163-8\" id=\"footnote-ref-11163-8\">[8]</a></sup>，说怿女美<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11163-9\" id=\"footnote-ref-11163-9\">[9]</a></sup>。<br>\n自牧归荑<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11163-10\" id=\"footnote-ref-11163-10\">[10]</a></sup>，洵美且异<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11163-11\" id=\"footnote-ref-11163-11\">[11]</a></sup>。<br>\n匪女之为美<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11163-12\" id=\"footnote-ref-11163-12\">[12]</a></sup>，美人之贻。</p>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>这是一首古老的爱情诗。开篇先以男子之口，引出一位娴静而美丽的女子。接着叙述她原本与男子约定相会，却“爱而不见”，令男子独自徘徊，这样的场景，表现了爱情萌发时的甜蜜和欢乐。接下来说静女赠送的彤管很美丽、讨人喜爱，后面又退一步说并非彤管好，而是因为它是美人赠送的。如此反复借彤管“表白”，其实都是抒发对静女的爱，真实且有情趣。诵读这首诗，思考“彤管”这类美好事物在诗中的象征作用，感受反复手法在表情达意上的作用。</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"footnote-11163-1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]静女其姝（shū）：娴静的女子很漂亮。姝，美丽、漂亮。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11163-1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11163-2\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]俟（sì）：等待。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11163-2\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11163-3\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]城隅：城角。一说指城上的角楼。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11163-3\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11163-4\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]爱：同“ （ài）”，隐藏。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11163-4\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11163-5\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]搔首踟蹰（chíchú）：以手指挠头，徘徊不进。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11163-5\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11163-6\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]娈（luán）：美好。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11163-6\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11163-7\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]彤管：红色的管状物。一说指初生时呈红色的管状的草。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11163-7\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11163-8\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]炜（wěi）：色红而光亮。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11163-8\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11163-9\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]说怿女美：喜爱你的美丽。说，同“悦”。怿，喜悦。女，同“汝”。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11163-9\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11163-10\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]自牧归荑（tí）：从远郊归来赠送我初生的茅草。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11163-10\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11163-11\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]洵美且异：确实美好而且与众不同。洵，诚然、实在。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11163-11\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11163-12\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]匪女之为美：并非你这荑草美。匪，同“非”，表示否定判断。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11163-12\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>","plain_text":"选自《诗经注析》（中华书局1991 年版）。 《诗经·邶风》 静女其姝[1]，俟[2]我于城隅[3]。 爱[4]而不见，搔首踟蹰[5]。 静女其娈[6]，贻我彤管[7]。 彤管有炜[8]，说怿女美[9]。 自牧归荑[10]，洵美且异[11]。 匪女之为美[12]，美人之贻。 这是一首古老的爱情诗。开篇先以男子之口，引出一位娴静而美丽的女子。接着叙述她原本与男子约定相会，却“爱而不见”，令男子独自徘徊，这样的场景，表现了爱情萌发时的甜蜜和欢乐。接下来说静女赠送的彤管很美丽、讨人喜爱，后面又退一步说并非彤管好，而是因为它是美人赠送的。如此反复借彤管“表白”，其实都是抒发对静女的爱，真实且有情趣。诵读这首诗，思考“彤管”这类美好事物在诗中的象征作用，感受反复手法在表情达意上的作用。 [color=red]静女其姝（shū）：娴静的女子很漂亮。姝，美丽、漂亮。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]俟（sì）：等待。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]城隅：城角。一说指城上的角楼。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]爱：同“ （ài）”，隐藏。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]搔首踟蹰（chíchú）：以手指挠头，徘徊不进。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]娈（luán）：美好。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]彤管：红色的管状物。一说指初生时呈红色的管状的草。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]炜（wěi）：色红而光亮。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]说怿女美：喜爱你的美丽。说，同“悦”。怿，喜悦。女，同“汝”。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]自牧归荑（tí）：从远郊归来赠送我初生的茅草。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]洵美且异：确实美好而且与众不同。洵，诚然、实在。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]匪女之为美：并非你这荑草美。匪，同“非”，表示否定判断。[/color] ↩︎","images":[],"links":[{"href":"#footnote-11163-1","text":"[1]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11163-2","text":"[2]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11163-3","text":"[3]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11163-4","text":"[4]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11163-5","text":"[5]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11163-6","text":"[6]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11163-7","text":"[7]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11163-8","text":"[8]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11163-9","text":"[9]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11163-10","text":"[10]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11163-11","text":"[11]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11163-12","text":"[12]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-1","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-2","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-3","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-4","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-5","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-6","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-7","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-8","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-9","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-10","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-11","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11163-12","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false}],"attachments":[]},{"id":11164,"post_number":2,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-21T15:59:15Z","updated_at":"2024-08-21T15:59:15Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<blockquote>\n<p>选自《文选》卷二十九（上海古籍出版社1986年版）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p>《古诗十九首》</p>\n<p>涉江采芙蓉<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11164-1\" id=\"footnote-ref-11164-1\">[1]</a></sup>，兰泽<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11164-2\" id=\"footnote-ref-11164-2\">[2]</a></sup>多芳草。<br>\n采之欲遗<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11164-3\" id=\"footnote-ref-11164-3\">[3]</a></sup>谁？所思在远道。<br>\n还顾望旧乡，长路漫浩浩。<br>\n同心而离居，忧伤以<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11164-4\" id=\"footnote-ref-11164-4\">[4]</a></sup>终老。</p>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>东汉中后期，游宦、游学之风盛行，大批士子远离故乡。作为文人五言诗滥觞的《古诗十九首》反映的就是这一现实，诗中充满了羁旅怀乡的思绪。这首诗的主人公采撷美草香花要送给“同心”的人，但他思念的人还在“旧乡”，长路漫漫，欲赠不能，只能让忧伤陪伴自己终老。全诗字里行间流露着漂泊他乡<br>\n和分隔两地的无奈。诵读这首诗，体会其“浅而能深、近而能远”（胡应麟《诗薮·内编》卷一）的特色。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"footnote-11164-1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]涉江采芙蓉：芙蓉，荷花。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11164-1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11164-2\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]兰泽：长着兰草的低湿之地。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11164-2\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11164-3\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]遗（wèi）：赠送。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11164-3\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11164-4\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]以：连词，表示结果。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11164-4\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>","plain_text":"选自《文选》卷二十九（上海古籍出版社1986年版）。 《古诗十九首》 涉江采芙蓉[1]，兰泽[2]多芳草。 采之欲遗[3]谁？所思在远道。 还顾望旧乡，长路漫浩浩。 同心而离居，忧伤以[4]终老。 东汉中后期，游宦、游学之风盛行，大批士子远离故乡。作为文人五言诗滥觞的《古诗十九首》反映的就是这一现实，诗中充满了羁旅怀乡的思绪。这首诗的主人公采撷美草香花要送给“同心”的人，但他思念的人还在“旧乡”，长路漫漫，欲赠不能，只能让忧伤陪伴自己终老。全诗字里行间流露着漂泊他乡 和分隔两地的无奈。诵读这首诗，体会其“浅而能深、近而能远”（胡应麟《诗薮·内编》卷一）的特色。 [color=red]涉江采芙蓉：芙蓉，荷花。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]兰泽：长着兰草的低湿之地。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]遗（wèi）：赠送。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]以：连词，表示结果。[/color] ↩︎","images":[],"links":[{"href":"#footnote-11164-1","text":"[1]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11164-2","text":"[2]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11164-3","text":"[3]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11164-4","text":"[4]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11164-1","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11164-2","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11164-3","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11164-4","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false}],"attachments":[]},{"id":11165,"post_number":3,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-21T16:02:59Z","updated_at":"2024-08-21T16:02:59Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<blockquote>\n<p>选自《南唐二主词校订》（中华书局2007 年版）。虞美人，词牌名。李煜（937—978），字重光，徐州（今属江苏）人，南唐后主，世称李后主。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p>《虞美人》</p>\n<p>春花秋月<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11165-1\" id=\"footnote-ref-11165-1\">[1]</a></sup> 何时了，往事知多少<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11165-2\" id=\"footnote-ref-11165-2\">[2]</a></sup>。<br>\n小楼昨夜又东风，故国<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11165-3\" id=\"footnote-ref-11165-3\">[3]</a></sup> 不堪回首月明中。<br>\n雕栏玉砌<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11165-4\" id=\"footnote-ref-11165-4\">[4]</a></sup>应犹在，只是朱颜改<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11165-5\" id=\"footnote-ref-11165-5\">[5]</a></sup>。<br>\n问君能有几多<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11165-6\" id=\"footnote-ref-11165-6\">[6]</a></sup>愁，恰似一江春水向东流。</p>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>李煜的这首词，将俘囚生活的幽怨、月夜听风的无眠、物是人非的无奈、愁怀难解的悲凉，以及对往日帝王生活的怀想，编织在一起，将亡国之痛、故国之思寄寓其中。词人通过具体的物象，把抽象的愁绪具象化，如“问君能有几多愁，恰似一江春水向东流”，千古流传，引发了不同时代人们的感叹，诵读时要细加品味。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"footnote-11165-1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]春花秋月：指季节的更替。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11165-1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11165-2\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]往事知多少：意思是多少往事都难以忘却。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11165-2\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11165-3\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]故国：指南唐。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11165-3\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11165-4\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]雕栏玉砌：雕饰华美的栏杆与用玉石砌成的台阶，指宫殿建筑。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11165-4\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11165-5\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]朱颜改：红润的容颜改变了，指人已憔悴。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11165-5\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11165-6\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]几多：多少。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11165-6\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>","plain_text":"选自《南唐二主词校订》（中华书局2007 年版）。虞美人，词牌名。李煜（937—978），字重光，徐州（今属江苏）人，南唐后主，世称李后主。 《虞美人》 春花秋月[1] 何时了，往事知多少[2]。 小楼昨夜又东风，故国[3] 不堪回首月明中。 雕栏玉砌[4]应犹在，只是朱颜改[5]。 问君能有几多[6]愁，恰似一江春水向东流。 李煜的这首词，将俘囚生活的幽怨、月夜听风的无眠、物是人非的无奈、愁怀难解的悲凉，以及对往日帝王生活的怀想，编织在一起，将亡国之痛、故国之思寄寓其中。词人通过具体的物象，把抽象的愁绪具象化，如“问君能有几多愁，恰似一江春水向东流”，千古流传，引发了不同时代人们的感叹，诵读时要细加品味。 [color=red]春花秋月：指季节的更替。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]往事知多少：意思是多少往事都难以忘却。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]故国：指南唐。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]雕栏玉砌：雕饰华美的栏杆与用玉石砌成的台阶，指宫殿建筑。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]朱颜改：红润的容颜改变了，指人已憔悴。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]几多：多少。[/color] ↩︎","images":[],"links":[{"href":"#footnote-11165-1","text":"[1]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11165-2","text":"[2]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11165-3","text":"[3]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11165-4","text":"[4]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11165-5","text":"[5]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11165-6","text":"[6]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11165-1","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11165-2","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11165-3","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11165-4","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11165-5","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11165-6","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false}],"attachments":[]},{"id":11166,"post_number":4,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-21T16:09:28Z","updated_at":"2024-08-21T16:09:28Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<blockquote>\n<p><em>选自《淮海居士长短句笺注》卷中（上海古籍出版社2008 年版）。鹊桥仙，词牌名。秦观（1049—1100），字少游，又字太虚，号淮海居士，高邮（今属江苏）人，北宋词人。</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p>《鹊桥仙》</p>\n<p>纤云弄巧<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11166-1\" id=\"footnote-ref-11166-1\">[1]</a></sup>，飞星传恨<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11166-2\" id=\"footnote-ref-11166-2\">[2]</a></sup>，银汉迢迢暗度<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11166-3\" id=\"footnote-ref-11166-3\">[3]</a></sup>。<br>\n金风<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11166-4\" id=\"footnote-ref-11166-4\">[4]</a></sup>玉露一相逢，便胜却<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11166-5\" id=\"footnote-ref-11166-5\">[5]</a></sup>人间无数。<br>\n柔情似水，佳期<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11166-6\" id=\"footnote-ref-11166-6\">[6]</a></sup>如梦，忍顾鹊桥归路<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11166-7\" id=\"footnote-ref-11166-7\">[7]</a></sup>！<br>\n两情若是久长时，又岂在朝朝暮暮<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11166-8\" id=\"footnote-ref-11166-8\">[8]</a></sup>。</p>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>这首词借鹊桥相会的传说，歌咏忠贞不渝的爱情。词人不认为织女和牛郎聚少离多值得哀怨，因为他们短暂的相会，远胜世人无数次的相聚，时空阻隔反而酿就了他们相会的甜蜜。词人还说，只要彼此情意长久，即使不能朝夕相守，也无须黯然神伤。诵读这首词，体会词人命意的高妙，理解他对爱情的独特见解。</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"footnote-11166-1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]纤云弄巧：纤细的云编织出各种巧妙的图案样式，比喻织女制作云锦的手艺高超。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11166-1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11166-2\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]飞星传恨：流星传递分别的愁苦。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11166-2\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11166-3\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]银汉迢迢暗度：夜里渡过辽阔的天河。传说每年农历七月七日夜，织女、牛郎借鹊桥越过天河相会。银汉，天河、银河。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11166-3\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11166-4\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]金风：秋风。五行学说以秋天与金相配。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11166-4\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11166-5\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]胜却：胜过。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11166-5\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11166-6\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]佳期：这里指重聚相守的美好时光。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11166-6\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11166-7\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]忍顾鹊桥归路：怎么忍心回望由鹊桥回去的路。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11166-7\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11166-8\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red]朝朝暮暮：指朝夕相守。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11166-8\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>","plain_text":"选自《淮海居士长短句笺注》卷中（上海古籍出版社2008 年版）。鹊桥仙，词牌名。秦观（1049—1100），字少游，又字太虚，号淮海居士，高邮（今属江苏）人，北宋词人。 《鹊桥仙》 纤云弄巧[1]，飞星传恨[2]，银汉迢迢暗度[3]。 金风[4]玉露一相逢，便胜却[5]人间无数。 柔情似水，佳期[6]如梦，忍顾鹊桥归路[7]！ 两情若是久长时，又岂在朝朝暮暮[8]。 这首词借鹊桥相会的传说，歌咏忠贞不渝的爱情。词人不认为织女和牛郎聚少离多值得哀怨，因为他们短暂的相会，远胜世人无数次的相聚，时空阻隔反而酿就了他们相会的甜蜜。词人还说，只要彼此情意长久，即使不能朝夕相守，也无须黯然神伤。诵读这首词，体会词人命意的高妙，理解他对爱情的独特见解。 [color=red]纤云弄巧：纤细的云编织出各种巧妙的图案样式，比喻织女制作云锦的手艺高超。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]飞星传恨：流星传递分别的愁苦。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]银汉迢迢暗度：夜里渡过辽阔的天河。传说每年农历七月七日夜，织女、牛郎借鹊桥越过天河相会。银汉，天河、银河。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]金风：秋风。五行学说以秋天与金相配。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]胜却：胜过。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]佳期：这里指重聚相守的美好时光。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]忍顾鹊桥归路：怎么忍心回望由鹊桥回去的路。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red]朝朝暮暮：指朝夕相守。[/color] ↩︎","images":[],"links":[{"href":"#footnote-11166-1","text":"[1]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11166-2","text":"[2]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11166-3","text":"[3]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11166-4","text":"[4]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11166-5","text":"[5]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11166-6","text":"[6]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11166-7","text":"[7]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11166-8","text":"[8]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-1","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-2","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-3","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-4","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-5","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-6","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-7","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11166-8","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false}],"attachments":[]}]}